Its non-negative least squares is a port of Lawson and Hanson's NNLS as
SciPy 1.11.4 distributes it (scipy/optimize/__nnls/nnls.f, BSD 3-Clause,
the SciPy Developers). Its fibre direction follows the WLS tensor fit of
DIPY 1.7 (BSD 3-Clause, the dipy developers).

Basser PJ, Mattiello J, LeBihan D (1994). Estimation of the effective
self-diffusion tensor from the NMR spin echo. J Magn Reson B 103(3):247-254.

Zhang H, Schneider T, Wheeler-Kingshott CA, Alexander DC (2012). NODDI:
practical in vivo neurite orientation dispersion and density imaging of the
human brain. NeuroImage 61(4):1000-1016.

Daducci A, Canales-Rodriguez EJ, Zhang H, Dyrby TB, Alexander DC, Thiran JP
(2015). Accelerated Microstructure Imaging via Convex Optimization (AMICO)
from diffusion MRI data. NeuroImage 105:32-44.

